# Plan Core Rules

## Input Processing
- Analyze requirements against current `@dev/rules/stack/`
- Create impact analysis (DB, API, UI changes)

## Output Format
- **File**: `docs/requirements/{feature-name}.md`
- **Template**: Use `@plan/templates/user-story.md`
- **AC**: Follow `@shared/templates/acceptance-criteria.md`

## Story Criteria
- Business value clear
- Acceptance criteria complete
- Dependencies identified
- Size: <10 files (split if larger)

## Handoff
- Update `@shared/integration/plan-dev.md` with [READY]
- Create `development/prompts/prompt-{feature-name}.md`

**No**: Technical implementation details. **Yes**: Business requirements only.